diff --git a/README_ADVANCED.md b/README_ADVANCED.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..7f12984
--- /dev/null
+++ b/README_ADVANCED.md
@@ -0,0 +1,88 @@
+# Aegis Advanced Platform Scaffold (FastAPI + gRPC, Compose + K8s YAML + Helm)
+
+This patch adds scaffolding for:
+1. Advanced RAG (hybrid retrieval hooks, rerank hooks, offline eval harness, tracing)
+2. Control plane vs data plane direction (control plane service with policy gate scaffolds)
+3. SLO-driven serving router (canary routing + Prometheus metrics endpoint)
+4. Governed training (MLflow hooks, dataset manifest, model card generator, promotion gate)
+
+## Local dev (Docker Compose)
+```bash
+docker compose up --build
+```
+
+Services:
+- Control plane: http://localhost:8000 + gRPC :50051
+- RAG service: http://localhost:8010 + gRPC :50052 (placeholder gRPC)
+- Serving router: http://localhost:8020 + gRPC :50053 (placeholder gRPC)
+- MLflow: http://localhost:5000
+
+## K8s plain YAML
+```bash
+kubectl apply -f k8s/yaml/namespace.yaml
+kubectl apply -f k8s/yaml/
+```
+
+## Helm
+```bash
+helm install aegis-control-plane helm/aegis-control-plane -n aegis --create-namespace
+helm install aegis-rag-service helm/aegis-rag-service -n aegis
+helm install aegis-serving-router helm/aegis-serving-router -n aegis
+helm install aegis-training helm/aegis-training -n aegis
+```
+
+## Next hardening steps
+- Replace in-memory stores with Postgres + Redis + queue (e.g., NATS/Kafka/Celery/RQ)
+- Add real vector store + embeddings pipeline + reranker (cross-encoder) + citations policy
+- Add real gRPC APIs for RAG and Serving Router (proto + clients)
+- Add OPA integration and signed audit logs
+- Add real model backend forwarding (vLLM/Triton) + SLO alerts + autoscaling rules
+
